@host = http://localhost:5169

### 1. List everything
GET {{host}}/api/character

### 2. Filter by class
GET {{host}}/api/character?class=Mage

### 3. Filter by minimum level
GET {{host}}/api/character?minLevel=5

### 4. Both filters at once
GET {{host}}/api/character?class=Warrior&minLevel=5

### 5. A class that does not exist
GET {{host}}/api/character?class=Wizard

### 6. One character
GET {{host}}/api/character/1

### 7. A missing character
GET {{host}}/api/character/99

### 8. Create (valid)
POST {{host}}/api/character
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kira", "class": "Rogue", "strength": 10, "intelligence": 12 }

### 9. Create (every rule broken)
POST {{host}}/api/character
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Al", "class": 99, "strength": 50, "intelligence": 0 }

### 10. Create (class word that does not exist)
POST {{host}}/api/character
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Merlin", "class": "Wizard", "strength": 5, "intelligence": 5 }

### 11. Create (trying to cheat)
POST {{host}}/api/character
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Cheater", "class": "Warrior", "strength": 20, "intelligence": 20,
  "level": 99, "hitpoints": 9999, "adminNote": "I am an admin" }

### 12. Update (valid)
PUT {{host}}/api/character/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Brynn the Bold", "strength": 19, "intelligence": 5 }

### 13. Update a missing character
PUT {{host}}/api/character/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost", "strength": 5, "intelligence": 5 }

### 14. Update (invalid)
PUT {{host}}/api/character/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "strength": 0, "intelligence": 21 }

### 15. Level up
POST {{host}}/api/character/3/levelup

### 16. Level up a missing character
POST {{host}}/api/character/99/levelup

### 17. Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/character/3

### 18. Delete the same one again
DELETE {{host}}/api/character/3
